{"1938100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Notmads", "steam_appid": 1938100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your home is a living beast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on its back and carry your home across the world. Fight, gather resources, and upgrade your gear, magic, and base as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notmads is an open world action RPG with fast-paced combat, building, and loot. Play in first or third person as your base moves with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take your home with you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beast carries your home across the world. You can stay with it or move ahead on your own when needed. It stays with you, and you can explore on your own whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4f825ed55caed6370dcd34be64367f09.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4f825ed55caed6370dcd34be64367f09.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4f825ed55caed6370dcd34be64367f09.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A magical home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home is more than a shelter. Powered by its core, it lets you build magical stations, refine materials, and shape your setup as you go. Add utilities and defensive towers to turn it into a moving fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/a2357ea8562f838529a2c0379c7f3f0f.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/a2357ea8562f838529a2c0379c7f3f0f.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/a2357ea8562f838529a2c0379c7f3f0f.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather without tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You gather resources through your Magical Beam, not axes or pickaxes. Improve it over time, unlock new ways to gather, and use the materials you find to refine resources, brew potions, combine gear, and improve your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/449a05934ccea272c2a4cfdcdc3c65e4.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/449a05934ccea272c2a4cfdcdc3c65e4.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/449a05934ccea272c2a4cfdcdc3c65e4.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape your magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mage, but you are not locked into one path. Focus on one style or mix different ones. Use fire, frost, lightning, arcane power, or physical strength, and find spells with different tiers, stats, and variations. Your gear, perks, and choices define how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/1976b1b7bf7d2679589e99dd7e19c2d1.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/1976b1b7bf7d2679589e99dd7e19c2d1.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/1976b1b7bf7d2679589e99dd7e19c2d1.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is handcrafted and meant to be explored at your own pace. You will come across towns, caves, camps, and hidden places, always looking for better loot, new materials, and the next step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/d56742c93f13fee94761bdc991dd7401.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/d56742c93f13fee94761bdc991dd7401.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/d56742c93f13fee94761bdc991dd7401.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or with friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 5 players online. Share the same living beast, build on the same moving home, explore together, and progress in a shared world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4a7c7fcf5f97a6fd038f12298abc34d1.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4a7c7fcf5f97a6fd038f12298abc34d1.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/4a7c7fcf5f97a6fd038f12298abc34d1.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home on the back of a living beast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the world with your moving base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first or third person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your beast move and follow you while you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build magical stations and defenses to grow your fortress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources using your Magical Beam instead of tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your Magical Beam over time to unlock new uses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, refine materials, and automate parts of your base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve and customize your gear to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot with different effects and strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of magic and combine them your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted world with towns, caves, and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in online co-op</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your home is a living beast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on its back and carry your home across the world. Fight, gather resources, and upgrade your gear, magic, and base as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notmads is an open world action RPG with fast-paced combat, building, and loot. Play in first or third person as your base moves with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.poster.avif?t=1784801355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.webm?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/5d04cc29dfb3d22bd70b7cbcb265b011.mp4?t=1784801355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><