ragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938100/extras/cae7f339b75d03ff9051604b7f7a9043.webp?t=1784801355\" alt=\"Separation line\" width=638 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home on the back of a living beast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the world with your moving base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first or third person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your beast move and follow you while you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build magical stations and defenses to grow your fortress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources using your Magical Beam instead of tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your Magical Beam over time to unlock new uses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, refine materials, and automate parts of your base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve and customize your gear to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot with different effects and strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of magic and combine them your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted world with towns, caves, and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in online co-op</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Your home is a living beast. Raise it, build on its back, and explore the world as it becomes a moving fortress. Fight, gather resources, and grow stronger alongside it in a fast-paced action RPG with progression, crafting, and exploration, playable solo or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, 